Object Privileges Table View Sequence ALTER ☑ ☑ DELETE ☑ ☑ INDEX ☑ INSERT ☑ ☑ REFERENCE ☑ SELECT ☑ ☑ ☑ UPDATE ☑ ☑ <p>Syntax</p> <pre><code>GRANT   -- object_priv [(columns)]
ON  -- object
TO  --{user| role | public}

[WITH GRANT OPTION];
</code></pre> <p>Example: </p> <p>Grant query privileges on the <code>employees</code> table;</p> <pre><code>GRANT SELECT
ON    employees
TO    duke;
</code></pre> <pre><code>GRANT  UPDATE (department_name, location_id)
ON     departments
TO     jayvee, manager;
</code></pre>
